# sim-benchmark-oss case allowlist.
#
# One <physics-class>/<case-id> per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Blank lines ignored.
#
# Anything NOT listed here stays in private only. publish_oss.py will warn
# (not auto-delete) about cases present in the oss tree but not on this list.
#
# To add a new public case: append the path here, then re-run
#   python tools/publish_oss.py
# from the private repo root.
#
# Hard rules (not enforced by code, just convention):
#  - Only open-source-solver cases (OpenFOAM, LTspice, SU2, CalculiX, Elmer).
#  - Commercial-solver cases (COMSOL, Fluent, CFX, Abaqus, ...) NEVER go here.
#  - Cases under cases/_pending/ or cases/_template/ are drafts and never go here.

# --- LTspice circuits (v0.1 MVP scored gate) ---
circuits/bridge_rectifier_ripple
circuits/diff_amp
circuits/half_wave_rectifier
circuits/inv_amp
circuits/lc_lowpass_2nd
circuits/lc_resonator
circuits/noninv_amp
circuits/opamp_buffer
circuits/opamp_integrator
circuits/opamp_summer
circuits/rc_highpass_ac
circuits/rc_lowpass_ac
circuits/rc_pulse_response
circuits/rl_lowpass_ac
circuits/rl_step
circuits/rlc_bandpass
circuits/rlc_notch
circuits/rlc_step_overdamped
circuits/rlc_step_underdamped
circuits/sallen_key_lp

# --- OpenFOAM fluids (v0.1 + initial v0.2 expansion) ---
fluids/flatplate_zpg_subsonic
fluids/lid_driven_cavity_re100
fluids/lid_driven_cavity_re1000
